  "id": "badminton",
  "name": "Badminton",
  "description": "Competing at national level in Belgium",
  "extendedDescription": "Badminton has been a core part of my life for years. I compete at national level — currently ranked in the top 60 in Belgium — and reached the top 16 at this year's Belgian Championships. Training and competing at that level requires a lot of discipline, tactical thinking, and consistency, which are qualities that carry over into everything else I do.\n\nI spend a significant amount of time each week on court, whether that's training sessions, tournaments, or practice matches. The combination of physical intensity and the need for quick decision-making is what keeps it interesting.",
